NOTE ON BUNDLED FONTS

This skill bundles two font files under `assets/template/fonts/` for
convenience:

- `STKAITI.TTF` — STKaiti (华文楷体), © Apple / DynaComware
- `wingding.ttf` — Wingdings, © Microsoft Corporation

These fonts are NOT covered by the MIT License above. They are included
solely so the template compiles out of the box on machines without them
pre-installed. Users are responsible for ensuring they have an appropriate
license (e.g. a macOS installation for STKaiti) for their use case.

If you intend to redistribute this skill publicly, consider substituting
freely-licensed CJK fonts such as LXGW WenKai (霞鹜文楷, SIL OFL) or Source
Han Serif (思源宋体, SIL OFL).
